title: Nationalities
card-image: img/cards/nationalities.svg
subtitle: The Ukrainian Rada, Finland and Transcaucasia.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: coalition_affairs
view-if: nationalities_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; nationalities_timer = 4

The empire's peoples want autonomy or independence: the Ukrainian Central Rada, the Finnish Diet, the Georgians, who vote Menshevik, the Baltic peoples, the Muslims of the Volga and Central Asia.

- @rada: Recognise the Ukrainian Rada's autonomy.
- @finland: Let the Finnish Diet govern its own affairs.
- @caucasus: Support a federal Transcaucasia led by the Georgian Mensheviks.
- @unity: Insist on the unity of the Russian state until the Assembly meets.
- @easy_discard

@rada
on-arrival: {!
RO.boost(Q, {nations: 4});
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: -4, right_threat: 2, rel_ally: 1});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 3);
!}

The Rada is recognised as the government of Ukraine's autonomy. Three Kadet ministers have resigned over it.

@finland
on-arrival: {!
RO.boost(Q, {nations: 2});
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: -2, right_threat: 1});
!}

The Finns are to govern their internal affairs. The question of independence is left for the Assembly.

@caucasus
on-arrival: {!
RO.boost(Q, {nations: 5});
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 1, 0);
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: -1});
Q.georgia_support = (Q.georgia_support || 0) + 1;
!}

Tsereteli, Chkheidze and Zhordania are Georgian Mensheviks. A federal Transcaucasia under their party would be the party's one secure base.

@unity
on-arrival: {!
RO.boost(Q, {nations: -4, middle: 1});
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: 3, right_threat: -1});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 1, -2);
!}

The unity of the Russian state was affirmed, and the national parties took note.
